  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RTITCP: Register heuristic dissector on TLS table",
  "description": "RTITCP only registered its heuristic dissector on the \"tcp\" table.\nWhen TLS decrypts the payload, it offers decrypted data to dissectors\nregistered on the \"tls\" table — RTITCP was not there, so RTPS-over-TLS\ntraffic appeared as generic \"Application Data\" even with correct keys.\n\nAdd a second heuristic registration on \"tls\", following the same\npattern used by HTTP, HTTP2, RPC, and other protocols that run over\nboth raw TCP and TLS.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Copilot)",
  "state": "merged",
